🇨🇴 The incoming administration of President-elect Abelardo de la Espriella is set to restore pro-security and pro-United States conservative leadership to the Republic of Colombia, setting the South American nation on the path to join a wave of new conservative leadership sweeping the Americas.

Watch to learn more about the top priorities of Colombia’s incoming administration as Foreign Minister-designate Omar Bula Escobar sits down with Heritage President @KevinRobertsTX 

